  "description": "I had a dream last night. I can’t seem to remember it... yet I feel like it was very important. Dreams connect us to others, to ourselves, to the past, present, and future. Dreams about you, dreams about me, and dreams about us. Dreams that seem far away yet will always remain in my heart. Dreams about dreams that are just one touch away from reality. Through our dreams, we are in contact, even if opening up is scary sometimes…\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
